en:
Press {Key:Right} while walking to roll. This
is useful when you want to move fast.
Don't forget! And if you want to {Color:Blue}save{Color:White}
during the game, press {Color:Blue}START{Color:White}
and choose SAVE from the {Color:Blue}Items
screen{Color:White} or the {Color:Blue}Quest Status screen{Color:White}.

cz:
Stiskni {Key:Right} pri chuzi pro kotrmelec.
Hodi se to, kdyz chces rychle se hybat.
Nezapomen! A kdyz chces {Color:Blue}ulozit{Color:White}
v prubehu hry, stiskni {Color:Blue}START{Color:White}
a vyber SAVE z {Color:Blue}obrazovky
predmetu{Color:White} nebo {Color:Blue}stavu mise{Color:White}.

